# GTA 6 Cheats & Codes (PS5 & Xbox Series X|S)

Searchable reference for **Grand Theft Auto VI (GTA 6)** cheat codes, unlock requirements, and D-pad button combinations on **PS5** and **Xbox Series X|S**.

> **Independent Fan Resource:** This project is an independent, fan-made guide and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Rockstar Games.

- **Live Website:** `https://baljinder-rgba.github.io/gta-6-cheats/`
- **Total Cheats in Game:** 61 across 5 categories (Player, Combat, Vehicle Spawns, Weather & Time, and Screen Filters)
- **Last Verified:** November 20, 2026

---

## How to Unlock & Enter Cheats in GTA 6

1. **Finish the main story:** Cheats only become available after completing the main campaign. Progress earned during the story counts toward challenge unlocks.
2. **Check the Progress menu:** Open the pause/map menu and go to **Progress → Cheats** to view unlocked cheats and challenge requirements.
3. **Open your phone:** Press **D-Pad Up** in free-roam to pull out the in-game phone.
4. **Hold shoulder buttons & enter D-pad arrows:**
   - **PS5:** Hold **L1** + **R1** while entering the D-pad sequence.
   - **Xbox Series X|S:** Hold **LB** + **RB** while entering the D-pad sequence.
5. **Save first:** Trophies/Achievements and session saving are affected while cheats are active—save manually beforehand.

